  "hadithGradeInfoDisclaimer": "Waɗannan gajerun kayan aikin karatu ne don taimaka muku fahimtar alamun da ake amfani da su a cikin wannan ɗakin karatu. Tattaunawar tantance darajar hadisan dalla-dalla na masana ne da takamaiman bincike.",
  "hadithGradeInfoCurrentBadge": "A halin yanzu",
  "hadithGradeInfoMuttafaqunAlayh": "Yawancin lokaci ana amfani da rahotannin da Imam al-Bukhari da Imam Muslim suka tattara. Sau da yawa masu karatu suna ɗaukar wannan azaman ɗaya daga cikin labulen ƙima mafi ƙarfi a cikin amfani da karatu gama gari.",
  "hadithGradeInfoSahih": "Gabaɗaya ana amfani da shi don rahoton da ake ɗauka a matsayin ingantacce kuma abin dogaro bisa ga hukuncin kima da aka haɗe da shi anan.",
  "hadithGradeInfoHasanSahih": "Ana amfani da shi lokacin da malamai suka siffanta rahoto da kalmomi kamar Hasan Sahih. Yana nuna wani rahoto mai ƙarfi, yayin da yake nuna harshen ƙima da tushen ko masana ke amfani da shi.",
  "hadithGradeInfoHasan": "Gabaɗaya ana amfani da shi don rahoton da ake ɗauka a matsayin sauti kuma abin karɓa, kodayake yawanci ana sanya shi ƙasa da Sahih a taƙaitaccen binciken gama gari.",
  "hadithGradeInfoWeak": "An yi amfani da shi don rahoton da ba a kula da shi da ƙarfin da zai iya tsayawa a matakin Sahih ko Hasan a cikin ƙimar da aka haɗe a nan.",
  "hadithGradeInfoBalagh": "An yi amfani da shi don rahoton da ake watsawa ta hanyar gajeriyar hanya ko kaikaice a wasu hadisai na tushe, don haka masu karatu su kula da shi tare da kulawa da fahimtar tushe.",
  "hadithGradeInfoOtherTitle": "Sauran lakabin daraja",
  "hadithGradeInfoOther": "Wasu rahotanni suna amfani da ƙayyadaddun kalmomi na ƙididdiga na tushe ko bayanan rubutu waɗanda ba su dace da ainihin sassauƙan rukunan da ke sama ba.",
