  "hadithNarratorRoleCompanion": "Sahabin Annabi ﷺ",
  "hadithNarratorRoleMotherOfBelievers": "Uwar Muminai kuma malami",
  "hadithNarratorRoleScholarCompanion": "Abokin da aka sani da ilimi da koyarwa",
  "hadithNarratorSummaryAbuHurairah": "Abu Hurairah Sahabin Manzon Allah SAW ne wanda ya shahara da kusanci da Manzon Allah SAW da yada hadisi mai yawa. A cikin wannan dakin karatu, ya yawaita a cikin ruwayoyi game da ibada, da hali, da tuba, da rayuwar musulmi ta yau da kullum.",
  "hadithNarratorSummaryAishah": "A’isha bint Abi Bakr, Allah Ya yarda da ita, ta kasance matar Manzon Allah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallama, kuma xaya daga cikin manyan malaman Sunnah. Riwayoyinta a cikin wannan ɗakin karatu sukan adana shiriya game da ibada, Alƙur’ani, ɗabi’a, da rayuwa a cikin iyalan gidan Annabi.",
  "hadithNarratorSummaryAbdullahIbnUmar": "Abdullahi bn Umar Sahabi ne da ya shahara wajen bin Sunnah da tsantsan da ibada. Riwayoyinsa a wannan dakin karatu sukan ta’allaka ne a kan addu’a, tafiye-tafiye, kamewa, da rayuwa tare da sanin Lahira.",
  "hadithNarratorSummaryAnasIbnMalik": "Anas bn Malik ya yi wa Manzon Allah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallama hidima a Madina kuma ya kawo hadisai masu yawa game da dabi’un Annabi, rahamarsa, da misalinsa na yau da kullum. A cikin wannan ɗakin karatu, ruwayoyinsa galibi suna ɗauke da shiriya mai amfani da ta kafu cikin abota da hidima.",
  "hadithNarratorSummaryJabirIbnAbdullah": "Jabir bn Abdullah Sahabi ne daga Ansar wanda ya ruwaito hadisi a kan ibada da ladubba da rayuwar al''umma. Riwayoyinsa a cikin wannan ɗakin karatu sukan kiyaye shiriyar da ke haɗa ibada da ayyukan yau da kullun.",
  "hadithNarratorSummaryAbdullahIbnAbbas": "Abdullahi bn Abbas dan uwan ​​Manzon Allah s.a.w ya shahara da ilimi da fahimta da koyarwa. A cikin wannan dakin karatu, ruwayoyinsa sukan bayyana inda hadisi ya danganta ibada da tunani, fahimta, da fahintar fahimta.",
