  "settingsHelpGuideSubtitle": "Gajerun jagorori masu amfani domin amfani da manyan fasalolin manhajar da tabbaci.",
  "settingsCategoryHelpGuideSubtitle": "Sauƙaƙan matakai don farawa, koyo, tunatarwa, da amfani da app na yau da kullun.",
  "settingsCategoryAboutSubtitle": "Bayanan sigar, tallafi, cikakkun bayanai na doka, da abin da ke gaba.",
  "settingsHelpGuideSearchHint": "Bincika jagorori",
  "settingsHelpGuideBrowseTitle": "Rukunin Jagora",
  "settingsHelpGuideBrowseSubtitle": "Buɗe wani batu don ganin gajeren bayani da matakai masu sauƙi.",
  "settingsHelpGuideSearchResultsTitle": "Sakamakon Bincike",
  "settingsHelpGuideSearchResultsSubtitle": "Batutuwan jagora suna sabuntawa yayin da kake rubutawa.",
  "settingsHelpGuideSearchEmptyTitle": "Ba a sami jagorar da ta dace ba",
  "settingsHelpGuideSearchEmptySubtitle": "Gwada kalma mafi sauƙi ko share bincikenka domin duba dukkan rukunin jagora.",
  "settingsHelpGuideStepsTitle": "Yadda ake Amfani da Shi",
  "settingsHelpGuideStepsSubtitle": "Ka bar kowane mataki cikin sauƙi kuma ka yi amfani da abin da yake taimaka maka a yanzu kawai.",
  "settingsHelpGuideNotFoundTitle": "Ba a sami jagora ba",
  "settingsHelpGuideNotFoundSubtitle": "Ba a iya buɗe wannan jagora a yanzu ba. Koma Help & Guide ka gwada wani batu.",
  "helpGuideGettingStartedTitle": "Fara Amfani",
  "helpGuideGettingStartedDescription": "Saita muhimman abubuwa na farko domin manhajar ta kasance mai amfani tun daga ranar farko.",
  "helpGuideGettingStartedStep1": "Buɗe Saituna don zaɓar wurinka, harshe, da zaɓuɓɓukan bayyanar gani.",
  "helpGuideGettingStartedStep2": "Duba lokutan sallah da yanayin tunatarwa domin jadawalin yau da kullum ya dace da tsarin rayuwarka.",
  "helpGuideGettingStartedStep3": "Yi amfani da Gida don ganin taƙaitaccen bayani na yau, sannan ka je Koyo ko Ibadah don zurfafa aiki.",
  "helpGuideSalahRemindersTitle": "Sallah da Tunatarwa",
  "helpGuideSalahRemindersDescription": "Ajiye lokutan sallah, tunatarwa, da saurin matakan gaba a cikin hanya guda.",
  "helpGuideSalahRemindersStep1": "Buɗe Saituna > Sanarwar Sallah don kunna tunatarwa da zaɓar yadda kowace sallah za ta faɗakar da kai.",
  "helpGuideSalahRemindersStep2": "Duba lokutan sallah a Saituna > Sallah da Ibadah idan kana buƙatar lokutan hannu, gyare-gyare, ko canjin Jumu''ah.",
  "helpGuideSalahRemindersStep3": "Lokacin da tunatarwa ta bayyana, za ka iya buɗe manhajar, jinkirta ta, ko alamar cewa an yi sallar idan wannan zaɓin yana nan.",
  "helpGuideQuranTitle": "Al-Qur''ani",
  "helpGuideQuranDescription": "Karanta, bincika, yi alama, kuma ka koma zuwa Al-Qur''ani ba tare da rasa wurinka ba.",
  "helpGuideQuranStep1": "Buɗe Koyo sannan ka shiga sashen Al-Qur''ani don duba surori, batutuwa, alamomi, da bayanin kula.",
  "helpGuideQuranStep2": "Yi amfani da filin bincike don nemo sura, aya, ko batu, sannan ka buɗe sakamakon da kake so.",
  "helpGuideQuranStep3": "Sauya saitunan Larabci, transliteration, da fassara daga Saituna > Koyo idan kana buƙatar wani salon karatu daban.",
  "helpGuideLearningTitle": "Koyo",
  "helpGuideLearningDescription": "Yi amfani da cibiyar koyo don motsawa tsakanin batutuwa masu jagora, darussa, da kayan dubawa.",
  "helpGuideLearningStep1": "Buɗe Koyo don zaɓar sashe kamar Al-Qur''ani, Hadisi, Rayuwa, Duniya, Annabawa, ko Gwaje-gwaje.",
  "helpGuideLearningStep2": "Taɓa katin rukuni don shiga wannan sashe, sannan ka buɗe darasi, kundin taro, ko hanya da ta dace da burinka.",
  "helpGuideLearningStep3": "Yi amfani da bincike idan kana son hanya mafi sauri zuwa batu, annabi, kalmar ƙamus, ko darasi.",
  "helpGuideDhikrAdhkarTitle": "Zikiri da Adhkar",
  "helpGuideDhikrAdhkarDescription": "Ka sauƙaƙa tuna Allah na yau da kullum da ƙirga, tarin jagorori, da tsarin da aka adana.",
  "helpGuideDhikrAdhkarStep1": "Buɗe Ibadah don samun Zikirin yau da kullum, ƙirgogi, da tarin adhkar.",
  "helpGuideDhikrAdhkarStep2": "Zaɓi wani tsari da ya dace da halin da kake ciki, sannan ka yi amfani da ƙirgar da ke ciki ko hanyar karatu a hankalinka.",
  "helpGuideDhikrAdhkarStep3": "Komawa Gida ko Ibadah daga baya don ci gaba da tsarin ka da duba ci gaban yau da kullum.",
  "helpGuideGrowthProgressTitle": "Ci gaba da Girma",
  "helpGuideGrowthProgressDescription": "Bibiyi dabi''u masu ɗorewa, streaks, XP, da hanyoyin mayar da hankali ba tare da manhajar ta yi nauyi ba.",
  "helpGuideGrowthProgressStep1": "Buɗe Tafiya don ganin streak ɗinka na yanzu, XP, hanyoyin girma, da wuraren mayar da hankali na yau.",
  "helpGuideGrowthProgressStep2": "Yi amfani da sashen hanya ko dabi''a don ci gaba a ƙaramin yanki guda na girma maimakon ƙoƙarin yin komai lokaci ɗaya.",
  "helpGuideGrowthProgressStep3": "Duba Gida don taƙaitaccen bayani idan kawai kana son ganin abin da ya rage na yau.",
  "helpGuideNotificationsSettingsTitle": "Sanarwa da Saituna",
  "helpGuideNotificationsSettingsDescription": "Daidaita tunatarwa, gani, widgets, harshe, da zaɓin asusu a wuri guda.",
  "helpGuideNotificationsSettingsStep1": "Buɗe Saituna daga babban manhaja don duba tunatarwa, bayyanar gani, koyo, sirri, da zaɓin iyali.",
  "helpGuideNotificationsSettingsStep2": "Yi amfani da sashen sanarwa da widget idan kana son faɗakarwa masu nutsuwa, halin live activity, ko canje-canjen allon kulle.",
  "helpGuideNotificationsSettingsStep3": "Yi amfani da Account Sync da Privacy & Data idan kana buƙatar ajiya, na''urorin da aka haɗa, ko sarrafawa masu alaƙa da sync.",
