  "quranThemePatienceTitle": "Hakuri",
  "quranThemePatienceDescription": "Begin with ayahs that connect hardship to prayer, trust, and a steadier response.",
  "quranThemeGratitudeTitle": "Godiya",
  "quranThemeGratitudeDescription": "Follow ayahs that teach thankfulness as worship, wisdom, and careful use of blessings.",
  "quranThemeMercyTitle": "Rahama",
  "quranThemeMercyDescription": "Explore mercy through gentleness, reconciliation, and the way believers carry other people’s weakness.",
  "quranThemeFamilyTitle": "Iyali",
  "quranThemeFamilyDescription": "Start with ayahs that place family responsibility, care, and counsel inside the life of faith.",
  "quranThemeAkhirahTitle": "Lahira",
  "quranThemeAkhirahDescription": "Yi nazarin lissafin lissafi, komowa, da kuma yadda Lahira ke sake fasalin gaggawa, bege, da muhimmancin ɗabi''a.",
  "quranThemeSignsInCreationTitle": "Alamomin Halitta",
  "quranThemeSignsInCreationDescription": "Tara ayoyin da suke mayar da duniyar halitta zuwa tunani, zikiri, da fahimtar hikimar Allah.",
  "quranThemeProphetsTitle": "Annabawa",
  "quranThemeProphetsDescription": "Yi amfani da misalan annabci don ganin yadda wahayi ya zama haƙuri mai rai, da’awa, dogaro, da jagoranci.",
  "quranThemeTrustInAllahTitle": "Dogara ga Allah",
  "quranThemeTrustInAllahDescription": "Begin with ayahs where reliance on Allah appears together with effort, consultation, and patient action.",
  "quranThemeRepentanceTitle": "Tuba",
  "quranThemeRepentanceDescription": "Follow ayahs that keep the door of return open through hope, reform, and renewed obedience.",
  "quranThemeRemembranceTitle": "Tunawa",
  "quranThemeRemembranceDescription": "Bincika yadda zikiri ke tabbatar da zuciya, da siffata aiki, da kuma kiyaye wahayi kusa da rayuwar yau da kullun.",
  "quranThemeSincerityTitle": "Ikhlasi",
  "quranThemeSincerityDescription": "Karanta ayoyin da suke tsarkake ibada, da niyya, da ibada, don haka ayyuka na Allah ne Shi kadai.",
  "quranThemePrayerTitle": "Addu''a",
  "quranThemePrayerDescription": "Farawa da ayoyin da suke nuna salah a matsayin kariya, taimako a cikin wahala, da anka tsakanin wahayi da ayyukan yau da kullun.",
  "quranThemeCharityTitle": "Sadaka",
  "quranThemeCharityDescription": "Tara ayoyin da suka tsara ciyarwa a matsayin ikhlasi, sadaukarwa, da kula da mabukata.",
  "quranThemeJusticeTitle": "Adalci",
  "quranThemeJusticeDescription": "Ka yi nazarin ayoyin da suke yin adalci tare da gaskiya da kamewa da nauyi a wurin Allah.",
  "quranThemeHumilityTitle": "Tawali''u",
  "quranThemeHumilityDescription": "Fara da ayoyin da suke gyara girman kai da koyar da tawali''u, da ƙarfi, da tsarkake kai.",
  "quranThemePatienceWhyItMatters": "Hakuri a cikin Alkur''ani ba jira ba ne. Tsayuwa na ibada ne ke sanya mumini yin addu''a, da fata, da aiki da gaskiya a lokacin da wahala ta shimfida ruhi.",
  "quranThemePatienceStudyFocus": "Ka lura da yadda ake haɗa sabar da addu''a, bege, gafara, da kamun kai. Taken shine game da tsayawa tsaye a cikin matsi, kada ku zama matsi.",
  "quranThemeGratitudeWhyItMatters": "Godiya tana kare ni''ima daga zama gafala. Alkur''ani ya gabatar da shukra a matsayin ibada, hikima, da kuma hanyar amfani da abin da Allah yake bayarwa a mafi kyawun alkibla.",
  "quranThemeGratitudeStudyFocus": "Ku lura cewa godiya ta fi yabo ga harshe. Ya bayyana tare da tunawa, tunani akan alamu, da amfani da hikimar lokaci, tanadi, da damar yau da kullun.",
  "quranThemeMercyWhyItMatters": "Rahama a cikin Alkur''ani duka abu ne da ake fata daga Allah da kuma wani abu da ake aikatawa tare da mutane. Yana sake fasalin gyara, afuwa, magana, da yadda mumini yake ɗaukar rauni.",
  "quranThemeMercyStudyFocus": "Ka lura da yadda jinƙai ke bayyana ta hanyar tausasawa, gafara, natsuwa da amsawa, da buɗe kofofin dawowa. Wannan jigon yana ƙara ƙarfi lokacin da kuke karanta shi ta hanyar ɗabi''a da kuma motsin rai.",
  "quranThemeFamilyWhyItMatters": "Iyali yana ɗaya daga cikin mafi bayyanan wuraren da bangaskiya ke bayyana. Alkur''ani ya danganta ibada ga hakkin iyaye, nasiha, kamewa, da kulawar yau da kullum a cikin gida.",
  "quranThemeFamilyStudyFocus": "Ka lura cewa ja-gorar iyali a nan tana da amfani. Yana game da magana, girmamawa, raba nauyi, da hikima a cikin dangantaka ta yau da kullun, ba kawai soyayya ba.",
  "quranThemeTrustInAllahWhyItMatters": "Tawakkali ga Allah yana tabbatar da mumini idan sakamako ya rasa tabbas. Alkur''ani ya danganta tawakkul ga biyayya, shawarwari, da bege bayan kokari na gaskiya maimakon kubuta daga alhakin.",
  "quranThemeTrustInAllahStudyFocus": "Ka lura cewa tawakkul baya cire aiki. Jigon yana ƙara bayyanawa lokacin da kuka karanta dogara tare da haƙuri, biyayya, da ƙin yanke ƙauna.",
  "quranThemeRepentanceWhyItMatters": "Tuba tana sanya bawa ya koma ga Allah maimakon ya daskare cikin laifi ko jinkirtawa. Kur''ani ya tsara tawbah kamar yadda mai bege ya koma don gyarawa da sabunta biyayya.",
  "quranThemeRepentanceStudyFocus": "Ka lura da yadda tuba ta bayyana tare da jinƙai, bege, da canji mai amfani. Taken shine game da komawa baya da gaskiya, ba kawai yin nadama ba.",
  "quranThemeRemembranceWhyItMatters": "Zikiri yana kiyaye wahayi kusa da rayuwa ta yau da kullun. Alkur''ani ya gabatar da zikiri a matsayin wani abu da yake daidaita zuciya, da siffata ibada, da kuma kiyaye mumini daga rayuwa cikin gafala.",
  "quranThemeRemembranceStudyFocus": "A lura cewa zikiri ba maimaitawa kadai ba ne. Yana bayyana tare da addu''a, godiya, tunani akan alamu, da zuciya mai karkata zuwa ga Allah a tsawon yini.",
  "quranThemeSincerityWhyItMatters": "Ikhlasi yana kāre bauta daga zama siffa, na yau da kullun, ko kuma rabe-raben niyya. Alkur''ani ya dauki ikhlasi a matsayin ginshikin ibada, ba karamin karin gyara ba.",
  "quranThemeSincerityStudyFocus": "Ku lura da yadda ikhlasi ke daure da ibada da dogaro da ingancin ayyuka. Wannan jigon yana ƙara ƙarfi lokacin da kuka karanta niyya tare da biyayya da gaskiya na ciki.",
