  "homeGlassPreviewReadabilityGentle": "Gentle",
  "homeGlassPreviewReadabilityBalanced": "Balanced",
  "homeGlassPreviewReadabilityHigh": "High",
  "homeGlassPreviewWarmTitle": "Warm Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewWarmDescriptor": "Amber warmth with a calm devotional glow",
  "homeGlassPreviewWarmBody": "Designed for prayer summaries, home reflections, and moments that should feel welcoming without becoming heavy. It keeps warmth close to the surface while preserving readable depth.",
  "homeGlassPreviewWarmChip": "Prayer summary fit",
  "homeGlassPreviewMilkyTitle": "Milky Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewMilkyDescriptor": "Cloudy ivory diffusion with softer transparency",
  "homeGlassPreviewMilkyBody": "Designed for calm, readable surfaces with gentle depth. It feels especially strong for devotional cards, prayer summaries, and serene learning moments that need quiet clarity.",
  "homeGlassPreviewMilkyChip": "Devotional favorite",
  "homeGlassPreviewCrystalTitle": "Crystal Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewCrystalDescriptor": "Sharper clarity with cooler reflective lift",
  "homeGlassPreviewCrystalBody": "Useful when you want the background to breathe through more clearly while still keeping titles crisp. It feels premium for highlights, featured insights, and polished showcase cards.",
  "homeGlassPreviewCrystalChip": "Sharper focus",
  "homeGlassPreviewNightTitle": "Night Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewNightDescriptor": "Smoky dusk layering with elegant low light",
  "homeGlassPreviewNightBody": "A darker surface for late-evening atmosphere without sliding into harsh black panels. It works best for reflective content, deeper reading moments, and richer nighttime presentation.",
  "homeGlassPreviewNightChip": "Night reflection",
  "homeGlassPreviewTintedTitle": "Tinted Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewTintedDescriptor": "Soft color infusion with warm rosier undertones",
  "homeGlassPreviewTintedBody": "This version brings a clearer sense of personality without turning neon or loud. It can suit featured reminders, curated editorial cards, and softer premium accents on home.",
  "homeGlassPreviewTintedChip": "Editorial accent",
  "homeGlassPreviewFrostedTitle": "Frosted Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewFrostedDescriptor": "Diffuse blur with quiet, paper-like softness",
  "homeGlassPreviewFrostedBody": "A stronger blur treatment that protects readability first. It feels dependable for practical cards, utility summaries, and any surface where the content should lead over the material.",
  "homeGlassPreviewFrostedChip": "Utility calm",
  "homeGlassPreviewLayeredTitle": "Layered Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewLayeredDescriptor": "Primary glass surface with a nested inner veil",
  "homeGlassPreviewLayeredBody": "Helpful when a card needs hierarchy inside hierarchy. The layered feel can support guided actions, richer dashboards, or sections where one calm panel sits inside another.",
  "homeGlassPreviewLayeredChip": "Nested hierarchy",
  "homeGlassPreviewEdgeLitTitle": "Edge-lit Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewEdgeLitDescriptor": "Subtle rim light with clearer luminous edges",
  "homeGlassPreviewEdgeLitBody": "This style adds a little more presence around the perimeter while keeping the center calm. It can work for featured destinations, premium shortcuts, and attention-worthy highlights.",
  "homeGlassPreviewEdgeLitChip": "Featured island",
  "homeGlassPreviewAdaptiveTitle": "Adaptive Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewAdaptiveDescriptor": "Tint and mood that shift with the surrounding atmosphere",
  "homeGlassPreviewAdaptiveBody": "Built to flex between warmer daylight and deeper evening surroundings. It aims for a stable middle ground that stays coherent across themes without demanding too much visual attention.",
  "homeGlassPreviewAdaptiveChip": "Theme-aware",
  "homeGlassPreviewSoftMatteTitle": "Soft Matte Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewSoftMatteDescriptor": "Velvety diffusion with reduced highlight sparkle",
  "homeGlassPreviewSoftMatteBody": "This leans toward softness over shine, which can help content feel grounded and restful. It may suit journaling, daily checkpoints, and spaces that should feel gentle rather than glossy.",
  "homeGlassPreviewSoftMatteChip": "Restful reading",
  "homeGlassPreviewDenseSanctuaryTitle": "Dense Sanctuary Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewDenseSanctuaryDescriptor": "Clouded sanctuary depth with the strongest calm cover",
  "homeGlassPreviewDenseSanctuaryBody": "One of the safest options for sacred, text-heavy moments because it shields the content from background noise. It feels especially fitting for duas, reflections, and focused spiritual summaries.",
  "homeGlassPreviewDenseSanctuaryChip": "Sanctuary tone",
  "homeGlassPreviewClearShowcaseTitle": "Clear Showcase Glass",
  "homeGlassPreviewClearShowcaseDescriptor": "High transparency with brighter display energy",
  "homeGlassPreviewClearShowcaseBody": "This is the most open and reflective option in the set. It is useful for comparison and premium showcase moments, though it needs careful contrast management before broader use.",
  "homeGlassPreviewClearShowcaseChip": "Most transparent",
  "legalAttributionsAdhanBody": "Tushen sautin tunatar da azan da aka haɗa cikin manhajar:\nhttps://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Adhan_wiki.oga\n\nAdireshin URL na asali:\nhttps://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/Adhan_wiki.oga\n\nMawallafin da aka lissafa a shafin tushen: Jarih (aikin kansa)\nLasisi: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-SA 3.0)\n\nBayani na yanzu: manhajar tana ɗauke da sautukan azan na wucin gadi da ake iya amfani da su ba tare da intanet ba, waɗanda aka samo daga wannan sautin da aka haɗa, har sai an sauya su da zaɓaɓɓun sautukan da za su maye gurbinsu.",
  "legalAttributionsAdhanTitle": "Sautin Sanarwar Azan",
