  "legalAttributionsQuranTitle": "Rubutun Alƙur''ani & Fassarori",
  "legalAttributionsRecitationBody": "Ana watsa ko zazzage karatuttukan Alƙur''ani daga tushen EveryAyah kamar Husary, Alafasy, da Abdul Basit.\n\nHanyoyin tushe:\nhttps://everyayah.com/\nhttps://everyayah.com/data/",
  "legalAttributionsRecitationTitle": "Sautin Karatun Alƙur''ani",
  "legalAttributionsSubtitle": "Rubutun Alƙur''ani, fassarori, tafsiri (transliteration), sauti, da amfani da API.",
  "legalAttributionsTransliterationBody": "Ana samo tafsirin (transliteration) daga AlQuran.cloud (bugu: en.transliteration) kuma ana adana shi a na''urar.\n\nHanyoyin tushe:\nhttps://alquran.cloud/api",
